    <Vocabulary>
        <p>
            Read from the eight component files and their stylesheets. <code>BadgeControl</code>, <code>AlertControl</code>, <code>SkeletonControl</code>,
            <code>TimelineControl</code> and <code>BreadCrumbControl</code> inherit <code>FlexControlBase</code>; its <code>CssClass</code>, <code>Style</code>
            and unmatched attributes land on each root element and are listed once, in the last table, together with the base parameters these controls
            never read. <code>TimelineItemControl</code> does not inherit it: it has no <code>CssClass</code> or <code>Style</code>, and an attribute it
            does not declare is a runtime error. <code>ChunkProgressBarControl</code> inherits it but uses it differently, so its inherited parameters
            are in its own table. <code>ProgressBarControl</code> does not inherit it: it declares its own <code>CssClass</code> and <code>Style</code>,
            and an attribute it does not declare is a runtime error.
        </p>
